config BR2_PACKAGE_PAPIRUS_ICON_THEME
	bool "papirus-icon-theme"
	help
	  The Papirus icon theme, in its three variants (Papirus,
	  Papirus-Dark, Papirus-Light): the Desktop's default icons
	  since 2026-11-22, with the Glacier colour themes. Every MIME
	  type the image knows draws an icon of its own in each variant
	  (board/desktop/check-mime-icons.py). About 250 MB on disk.
	  The other variants in the archive (ePapirus, …) are not
	  installed.

	  https://github.com/PapirusDevelopmentTeam/papirus-icon-theme
